Subject: Blocksize
Message-ID: <RKKPtFBbOHo.jE0XWV7tNQ8J@rhipe.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/rhipe/c/RKKPtFBbOHo/m/jE0XWV7tNQ8J>
